WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.076 --> 00:00:01.267
- If men don't shave, it's sort of

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:03.481
just seen as a fashion choice.

00:00:03.957 --> 00:00:05.540
I feel like if women don't shave,

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:09.441
a lot of times it's seen as,
like, a political choice.

00:00:09.441 --> 00:00:13.467
(funky soul music)

00:00:13.467 --> 00:00:15.687
- [Voiceover] We convinced
four of our co-workers

00:00:15.687 --> 00:00:17.213
to give up shaving for a month

00:00:17.213 --> 00:00:19.510
to see how their
perspectives would change.

00:00:19.510 --> 00:00:21.252
This is what happened.

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:26.206
- I'm so excited because
I hate shaving so much.

00:00:26.206 --> 00:00:28.900
- I'm excited, but I'm nervous.

00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:31.516
- There's gonna be like, all
this weird social anxiety,

00:00:31.516 --> 00:00:33.481
but yet, I think part
of me is kind of excited

00:00:33.481 --> 00:00:35.648
to have an excuse to not shave.

00:00:35.648 --> 00:00:37.536
I've done No-Shave November before,

00:00:37.536 --> 00:00:40.067
so I'm no stranger to
not shaving for a month.

00:00:40.067 --> 00:00:41.903
- I don't think I've ever not shaved

00:00:41.903 --> 00:00:43.543
for a whole month before.

00:00:43.543 --> 00:00:46.004
- I feel like I'm going
to be both in anguish

00:00:46.004 --> 00:00:47.762
and liberated at the same time.

00:00:47.762 --> 00:00:49.510
- I'm the most nervous about my armpits.

00:00:49.510 --> 00:00:52.157
I have some hairy armpits, I'm nervous

00:00:52.157 --> 00:00:54.386
that like three weeks in, two weeks in,

00:00:54.386 --> 00:00:56.685
I'm just gonna be like, "Uh,
why did I sign up for this?

00:00:56.685 --> 00:00:58.117
"I feel disgusting."

00:01:01.538 --> 00:01:03.604
We're two weeks in to
the non-shaving thing.

00:01:03.604 --> 00:01:05.532
- Things are definitely getting hairy.

00:01:05.532 --> 00:01:07.110
- I've finally crossed that line

00:01:07.110 --> 00:01:09.897
where it's definitely doesn't
look like I forgot to shave,

00:01:09.897 --> 00:01:12.265
it looks like I'm
intentionally not shaving.

00:01:12.265 --> 00:01:14.053
- Got a pretty, pretty thick beard here.

00:01:14.053 --> 00:01:15.887
It's pretty, pretty dense,
I haven't really gotten

00:01:15.887 --> 00:01:17.459
too many crazy looks or anything.

00:01:17.459 --> 00:01:19.068
- I've been wearing short-sleeved shirts,

00:01:19.068 --> 00:01:21.088
