start wearing a lot of, like,

00:01:26.178 --> 00:01:28.816
long sleeves, I'm gonna try not to.

00:01:30.024 --> 00:01:31.374
It's gonna be hard.
- [Sarah] The idea

00:01:31.374 --> 00:01:33.019
