- [Becky] I should be

00:01:33.019 --> 00:01:34.784
more confident, I should
be more comfortable,

00:01:34.784 --> 00:01:37.477
I shouldn't give a (bleep),
but it's an adjustment.

00:01:37.477 --> 00:01:39.816
- It's been pretty great,
I don't think there's been

00:01:39.816 --> 00:01:41.982
