00:01:45.058 --> 00:01:50.058
- I'm going to wear a tank top today.

00:01:51.263 --> 00:01:53.284
And this is what's going on.

00:01:53.284 --> 00:01:55.172
- Side profile's the best,
'cause you can see it,

00:01:55.172 --> 00:01:57.454
there it is, there it is, look at that.

00:01:57.454 --> 00:01:59.457
Oh my gosh, look at that!

00:01:59.459 --> 00:02:03.059
